# Archestimator Cursor Adapter

This legacy file exists for Cursor back-compatibility. It is not a project brain
or a complete ruleset.

1. Follow `AGENTS.md`.
2. Read only the FAST PATH in `.ai/10_state/current-state.md`.
3. Load `.cursor/rules/README.md` and only the glob-scoped rule for the files
   being changed.
4. Use
   `.ai/08_prompts/000_Planning Prompts/Multi-Agent-Execution-Directive.md`
   when native agents, parallel threads, emulated specialist passes, or
   coordinated ownership are selected.

Cursor adapters cannot override repository safety, current
`wrangler.jsonc`/source facts, Direct/Brief/Plan Pack routing, or
`NOT_REQUIRED|TEST_PROPOSAL|TEST_TASK`. Preserve the shared worktree and do not
copy canonical policy into this file.
